<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-erecta-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg–Turing critical wavelength for Drosophila erecta at 2.262 µm (Pass 2) — Code-to-model traceability: 86/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "critical_kc2 cites the Turing quotient. Lean theorems pin 2262 nm < 101100 nm and 100600 nm, the δ=16 threshold 16×691 > 1210, and the equal-diffusion failure. The script's self-test checks those same inequalities." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-erecta-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-erecta-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-erecta-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg–Turing critical wavelength for Drosophila erecta at 2.262 µm (Pass 2) — Model fidelity to source: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "k_c^2 = (Dv fu + Du gv)/(2 Du Dv) is solved so the physical wavelength is 2.262 µm (Du=3.987e-14 m^2/s, δ=16). Trace=-0.519 and det=1.210, so the homogeneous state is stable until diffusion. The disk-mode envelope is an extra radial fit on top of that law, which is why this is not 100." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-erecta-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-erecta-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-erecta-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg–Turing critical wavelength for Drosophila erecta at 2.262 µm (Pass 2) — Morphometric validation: 86/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Annulus Pearson r=0.99803 against reference ceiling 1.0 (RMSE=1.966, so the series are not copies). KS=0.064 against anchor 0.5. Segmented ring radius 97.30 µm against the elegans primordium anchor 101.1 µm. PDE patch grows by 3.36× at the critical mode; the negative controls fall below 1e-4." ;
