<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-erecta-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg–Turing critical wavelength for Drosophila erecta at 2.262 µm (Pass 2) — MorphoEval overall 86.9/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Dispersion wavelength is 2.262 µm at a=0.17, b=0.93, Dv/Du=16, age 0 Ma. Gallery annulus Pearson r=0.99803, RMSE=1.966 gray levels, KS=0.064. Annulus radius 97.30 µm versus the elegans primordium anchor 101.1 µm. δ sweep λ falls 2.847, 2.415, 2.310, 2.262, 2.217, 2.183 µm. Critical-mode std ratio 3.36; equal-diffusion ratio 7.5e-5; ablation ratio 2.1e-7. Dark/light production shift 1.24 exceeds wavelength shift 0.30. Wavenumber versus elegans is ×44.69. GIF CV similarity against the gallery image is 82.0 (16 frames, 640×480). Overall 86.9/100 (faithfulness 85.7, reproducibility 89.6); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 88, Morphological realism / specimen match 82, Parameter expressivity 90, Morphometric validation 86, Source and data traceability 92, Code-to-model traceability 86, Reproducibility package 90. Output judged: docs/media/drosophila_erecta_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-drosophila-erecta-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc, image/png, 637721 B, 1380×984 px, artifact_sha256 e24b0d85978700ec78d0f2f734fb63f541d56e137659633304cce79fe82c81eb (sha256 e24b0d85978700ec78d0f2f734fb63f541d56e137659633304cce79fe82c81eb), spec_fingerprint 944cf6527af7b0d5c21d4cf33a0403c90ad4f3ca2ab561dcf67e43e4ef7022f3. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 944cf6527af7b0d5c21d4cf33a0403c90ad4f3ca2ab561dcf67e43e4ef7022f3; artifact_sha256: e24b0d85978700ec78d0f2f734fb63f541d56e137659633304cce79fe82c81eb; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/drosophila_erecta_turing_wavelength_s0/drosophila_erecta_specimen.jpg=ef1ddb031fefd5f8..., datasets/drosophila_erecta_turing_wavelength_s0/drosophila_erecta_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=db334ff62f6ae794..., datasets/drosophila_erecta_turing_wavelength_s0/paper_citations.bib=2b2bacd184e5772d...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-27-drosophila-erecta-turing-wavelength-s0-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing 1952 dispersion relation | Schnakenberg 1979 kinetics | Yassin et al. 2016 tan balancing selection in female D. erecta | Gallery image has a drawn 100 µm scale bar (measured run 111 px); reconstructed_in_script: Du = 3.987e-14 m^2/s and Dv = 6.380e-13 m^2/s so lambda_c = 2.262 µm | Dark a=0.29 and light a=0.08 at fixed Du, Dv | Damped J0 disk mode fitted to the gallery radial profile | Fourier ring at 2.262 µm used as the fine texture on the GIF; transfer_boundary: 2.262 µm is the assigned detail tier, not a length Yassin et al. measured | The 97.3 µm dark ring is the primordium-scale annulus in the same image, not the detail wavelength; does_not_claim: Does not claim geological age changes among elegans, erecta, and eugracilis (all 0 Ma) | Does not claim the tan enhancer numerically equals Dv/Du | Does not claim a wild-caught CC photograph was obtained." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: {'id': 'R1', 'item': 'Resolved in this pass: δ sweep is monotonic (2.847 µm at δ=4 down to 2.183 µm at δ=40).', 'status': 'resolved'}",
        "remediation needed: {'id': 'R2', 'item': 'Resolved in this pass: equal-diffusion std ratio 7.5e-5 and ablation ratio 2.1e-7 versus critical-mode ratio 3.36.', 'status': 'resolved'}",
        "remediation needed: {'id': 'R3', 'item': 'Resolved in this pass: Pearson r=0.99803, RMSE=1.966, KS=0.064, ring 97.30 µm ≠ 101.1 µm anchor, GIF CV=82.0.', 'status': 'resolved'}",
        "remediation needed: {'id': 'R4', 'item': 'No second assessor from another provider. Still open.', 'status': 'open'}",
        "remediation needed: {'id': 'R5', 'item': 'No CC wild photograph. Gallery fallback remains the specimen. Still open.', 'status': 'open'}" ;
    pk:hasScore 8.69e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-erecta-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg–Turing critical wavelength for Drosophila erecta at 2.262 µm (Pass 2) — Parameter expressivity: 90/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "At fixed Du, λ(δ) for δ=4,8,12,16,24,40 is 2.847, 2.415, 2.310, 2.262, 2.217, 2.183 µm, strictly decreasing. Dark versus light production shift is 1.235 while the wavelength shift is 0.305. Equal diffusion and autocatalysis removal both kill the pattern." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-parameter-expressivity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
